  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $228,686 Technical Assistance (TA) activity, entitled Energy Demand and Supply Projections and Energy Planning, provides assistance to Turkey&apos;s Ministry of Energy and Natural Resources (MENR). The TA includes a needs assessment and the development of two sets of training courses and workshops to assist MENR officials in applying models developed by the Department of Energy&apos;s Argonne National Laboratory to the Turkish electricity market.</narrative>
  </description>
